  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Roast wedges: Preheat the oven to 220C, fan-forced. Line a large oven tray with baking paper. Cut the unpeeled potatoes into wedges and put on the lined tray. Drizzle with 1 tbs olive oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat. Roast for 30 mins or until tender.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/743611/photos/large/roast_wedges-9f5702334c18985476ad0ea10b37d866.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Meanwhile, cut the capsicum into 2cm chunks. Thinly slice the spring onion. Crush or finely chop 2 garlic cloves. Drain and rinse the beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/743612/photos/large/prep_ingredients-2fb7bfb443adad07f30ad1f666301d73.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Soften capsicum: Heat 1 tbs olive oil in a medium deep frypan over medium heat. Cook the capsicum and garlic, stirring, for 4 mins or until softened.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/743613/photos/large/simmer_beans-d59a13bf11b6d6bf6668332fb07341b9.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Simmer beans: Add the beans, tomatoes, barbecue seasoning, 1 tbs tomato paste, 1 tsp honey and 60ml (¼ cup) water to the capsicum mixture and bring to the boil. Reduce the heat to medium and cook, stirring occasionally, for 8-10 mins until slightly thickened. Remove the pan from the heat. Taste, then season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/743614/photos/large/load_up_wedges-46a9fe3332277b5ad17513d168117c57.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Divide the wedges and smoky beans among bowls and scatter over the spring onion. Serve with the burger sauce and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/743616/photos/large/serve_up-45a8f4e97ddde0d78b090f815c4ae274.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: Like things cheesy? If you have some grated cheese in your fridge, sprinkle it over the bean mixture to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/743618/photos/large/make_it_yours-c83d3fe541e311addaa08f8286ce95c2.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
